ifference is probably within simulation noise. If L1 is confirmed compliant, a threshold of 35\u201340 GeV is equivalent in practice.\n  - **Other algorithms:** L3 is similarly flat between 30 and 40 GeV, and L2 is flat between 30 and 40 GeV.\n\nI recorded the zero count of verified-compliant options, the provisional L1 result at 40 GeV, and the L3 and L2 fallbacks.", "type": "text"}]}
